      "description": "The shadows or highlights wheel: Auto ([0, 0], or Apple Auto's colour for that zone, docs/19 section 5), or a manual point. A plain point is an older document: it reads as Manual at that point, and [0, 0] as Auto.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/auto"
