      "description": "One pin of the colour warp: the colours near `source` move to `target`. Every property but `source` may be left out and takes the default shown (`target`: the source). A locked pin holds the colours within its range in place; its target is its source and its weights, pivot, exposure and saturation are the defaults.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "source"
